{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06449","headline":"送卢少府赴延陵 · 李颀","name":"送卢少府赴延陵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"问君从宦所，何日府中趋。\n遥指金陵县，青山天一隅。\n行人怀寸禄，小吏献新图。\n北固波涛险，南天风俗殊。\n春江连橘柚，晚景媚菰蒲。\n漠漠花生渚，亭亭云过湖。\n滩沙映村火，水雾歛樯乌。\n回首东门路，乡书不可无。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李颀","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06449.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06449","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}